  "ownership": "Native ABI owners supersede the historical function-ownership hints. Portable goodix_primitives scratch/boolean APIs are separate APIs and are not qualified native owners.",
  "semantics": [
    "One 44-byte output record is selected from summary+8. Common count flags and record readiness/metric/correlation flags are masked and stored at byte41 before live score loads.",
    "The summary halfword at+4 is sign-extended and then compared unsigned to the descriptor word. Correlation is a signed byte. Raw signed clamps preserve the native treatment of negative encodings, NaNs and the -1 metric sentinel.",
    "Metric comparisons use ordered GT; logistic slope selection uses C so unordered selects the upper slope. FZ inputs and FPSCR invalid/sticky/control bits are preserved through compiler intrinsics.",
    "Three logistic scores use actual C expf and encoded software-double conversion/multiply/add providers. Each weighted contribution is rounded through binary32 before the next. The first add includes positive zero. Final clamp compares signed raw bits against100.0; unsigned RTZ conversion uses the verified C helper.",
    "The normal caller includes a shared typed header, replacing the void declaration with the native uint32 result. Its object is unchanged. No assembly, algorithm models, executable arrays, new state or stock code fallback are added."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Emulated checks do not prove physical sensor behavior, interrupt concurrency or complete startup.",
    "Independent finite score oracles exclude three cases within0.001 of an integer boundary; all1440 cases retain exact stock comparison.",
    "The independent logistic oracle uses2e-5 absolute tolerance under nearest rounding. Exact native comparisons cover all32 FP configurations.",
    "The source tests use real source-owned math providers, including preexisting arithmetic assembly in some transitive math units.",
    "The normal build is relocatable composition with84 application and22 boot imports. Seven later SpO2 stages, including summary, remain unresolved.",
    "Native instruction coverage proves execution of all572 body bytes, not exhaustive path or input coverage."
  ],
